# Production builds are served BY the ARI OS daemon, from its own origin.
#
# `src/data/source.ts` runs the in-browser simulation whenever `VITE_ARI_API` is
# unset, so this one line is the difference between a console that shows
# fixtures and one that shows the kernel. A RELATIVE base keeps it same-origin:
# the console talks to whichever daemon served it, which is what makes the
# strict `connect-src 'self'` CSP in `src/control/index.ts` possible and why
# `@fastify/cors` is not registered on that surface.
#
# `vite dev` runs in development mode and does not read this file, so the dev
# server keeps its fixtures.
VITE_ARI_API=/api
